sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Someone joins
    participant I1 as App instance 1
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant K as Kafka
    participant RD as Redis channel circl:seats
    participant I2 as App instance 2
    participant V as Viewer's browser

    V->>I2: GET /activities/42/seats (EventSource)
    I2-->>V: event: seats {capacity 10, seatsTaken 6}
    U->>I1: POST /activities/42/join
    I1->>DB: seat UPDATE + outbox row, one transaction
    loop every 2 s
        I1->>DB: outbox relay picks the event
    end
    I1->>K: publish ParticipantJoined (key = activity 42)
    K-->>I1: live-seats consumer gets it
    I1->>DB: read fresh seat numbers
    I1->>RD: PUBLISH {seatsTaken 7}
    RD-->>I1: message
    RD-->>I2: message
    I2-->>V: event: seats {seatsTaken 7}
    Note over V: a dot on the ring fills in
